                <div class="col-lg-9">
                    <details class="faq-item" data-aos="fade-up">
                        <summary>What sizes of portable cabins do you fabricate, and can you build custom sizes?</summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">We fabricate standard sizes from 2m &times; 3m guard cabins up to 3.75m &times; 9m accommodation units and 40ft container offices &mdash; see the sizes table above. Every cabin is built to order, so custom dimensions, layouts and fit-outs are available. Share your requirements and we will quote for your exact size.</div>
                    </details>
                    <details class="faq-item" data-aos="fade-up">
                        <summary>What are your cabins made of?</summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Double-welded steel frames with EPS / Rockwool sandwich panels and a premium epoxy finish. The insulation is engineered to hold 22&deg;C inside even when it is 50&deg;C outside, and electrical, plumbing and communication systems are pre-installed.</div>
                    </details>
                    <details class="faq-item" data-aos="fade-up">
                        <summary>How long does fabrication and delivery take?</summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">It depends on the size, specification and our current order book. We work to fast turnaround times — guard cabins are typically ready in 5–10 working days, and standard portable office cabins can also be fabricated and delivered quickly. Send us your drawings or requirements and we will confirm a fabrication and delivery schedule with your quote.</div>
                    </details>
                    <details class="faq-item" data-aos="fade-up">
                        <summary>Do you provide maintenance support after delivery?</summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Yes. Every cabin is delivered turnkey with ongoing maintenance support throughout the project lifecycle, so your units remain in top condition for their full 15–20 year lifespan with standard maintenance. See our <a href="/portable-cabin-maintenance-qatar">portable cabin maintenance</a> page for details.</div>
                    </details>
                    <details class="faq-item" data-aos="fade-up">
                        <summary>Do you deliver and install across Qatar?</summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Yes. We deliver fully assembled or flat-pack units direct to your project site, and our specialised crew handles on-site installation &mdash; across Doha, Lusail, Al Wakrah, Al Rayyan, Mesaieed, Al Khor, Ras Laffan and beyond.</div>
                    </details>
                    <details class="faq-item" data-aos="fade-up">
                        <summary>What is included in the price?</summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Electrical, plumbing and communication systems are pre-installed in every cabin. Air conditioning, furniture and other extras depend on your specification. Indicative prices are listed on our <a href="/portable-cabin-price-in-qatar">portable cabin price guide</a> &mdash; your final price is confirmed on quotation.</div>
                    </details>
                    <details class="faq-item" data-aos="fade-up">
                        <summary>Can cabins be stacked or joined together?</summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Yes. We build single and double-storey cabins, and modular units can be joined side-by-side into larger offices, workforce camps and command centres. See our <a href="/site-cabins-offices-welfare-accommodation">site cabins &amp; welfare accommodation</a> for larger configurations.</div>
                    </details>
                </div>
